
# tcl-lsp

The Linux packages (the nix package, the .tar.zst bundle, the AppImage and the
gateway image built from the nix package) also ship tcl-lsp, the Tcl language
server the Dev tab starts: MIT OR Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/77787777778777/tcl-lsp, at the revision flake.lock pins. It
runs nagelfar (GPL-3.0-or-later) and tclint/tclfmt (MIT) as separate programs.
tcl-lsp links the Rust crates below; each license text is reproduced once,
followed by the crates it covers.

